---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
import RecentPosts from '@/components/RecentPosts.astro'
---

<Layout>
  <div class="mx-auto w-11/12 lg:w-7/10">
    <section class="my-16 text-lg">
      <p class="my-8">
        Hi, I'm Leo, a software engineer, basketball enthusiast, and Counter Strike tactician.
      </p>
      <p class="my-8">
        I mostly work as a backend develeper on Java web applications. I'm familiar with
        containerized applications, OpenShift (k8s) and cloud providers such as AWS and Azure. I
        also host bi-weekly sprint retrospective and planning meetings.
      </p>
      <p class="my-8">
        Playing basketball and
        <a href="https://www.counter-strike.net/" target="_blank" class="text-primary"
          >Counter Strike</a
        >
        are my favourite hobbies.
      </p>
      <p class="my-8">I've been traveling more lately and hopefully getting some good photos.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="my-16">
      <RecentPosts />
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
